title: ClickFix command put on the clipboard
severity: critical
score: 80
tags: clickfix
attack: T1204.004, T1059
description: The page put a command on the clipboard. The command has a ClickFix trait, or
  the page tells the visitor to paste it into the Run dialog or a terminal. ClickFix traits:
  a download cradle, hidden or encoded PowerShell, mshta of a URL, a finger.exe or for /f
  fetch-and-run, caret obfuscation, or a fake-CAPTCHA comment or padded decoy.
---
// A clipboard command with a ClickFix trait, or any clipboard command on a page that
// tells the visitor to paste into Run or a terminal.
clipboard_commands
| where trait in ("unambiguous", "cradle") or exists(run_dialog_pages)
| project command = substring(text, 0, 1000), trait, api, frame_url
